{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23234","headline":"赠江州李十使君员外十二韵 · 白居易","name":"赠江州李十使君员外十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我本江湖上，悠悠任运身。\n朝随卖药客，暮伴钓鱼人。\n迹爲烧丹隐，家缘嗜酒贫。\n经过剡谿雪，寻觅武陵春。\n岂有疎狂性，堪爲侍从臣。\n仰头惊凤阙，下口触龙鳞。\n劒佩辞天上，风波向海滨。\n非贤虚偶圣，无屈感求伸。\n昔去曾同日，今来即後尘。\n中年俱白发，左宦各朱轮。\n长短才虽异，荣枯事略均。\n殷勤李员外，不合不相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}